# Afsplug
===
An enhanced Chat2API branch that connects to mainstream AI models through their official web interfaces and exposes an OpenAI-compatible API. Supports DeepSeek, GLM, Kimi, MiniMax, Qwen, Z.ai and other providers, and works with any OpenAI-compatible client.
